Playbook PrincessBehaviour:
    when food_served: IF likes_food DO eat_food ELSE SIGNAL ask_pretender_food.
    when ball_startd: SIGNAL ask_pretender_dance.
Playbook PretenderBallBehavior:
    WHEN ALWAYS: DO talk_to(Princess).
when PRINCESS  ask_pretender_food: 
        start SUBPLOT SearchFood MAPPING Self TO Searcher.